- **Hybrid Energy Systems**: Oil and gas companies are increasingly exploring hybrid energy systems that integrate renewable energy sources. For instance, TotalEnergies has invested in solar and wind projects to power its offshore oil platforms, reducing the carbon footprint of its operations and setting a precedent for sustainable practices within the industry.

